{"seq":2,"slug":"primitives-and-literal-types","title":"原始类型与字面量类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/basic-types/primitives-and-literal-types","wordCount":824,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"原始类型与字面量类型\">原始类型与字面量类型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TypeScript 的类型系统以 JavaScript 的七种原始类型为基础，同时引入了<strong>字面量类型</strong>机制，可以将类型精确到某个具体的值。原始类型描述值的&quot;种类&quot;，字面量类型描述值的&quot;具体内容&quot;。两者结合，构成了类型系统从宽泛到精确的完整光谱。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;TypeScript Types&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Primitive Types&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Object Types&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;string&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;number&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;boolean&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; G[&quot;null&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; H[&quot;undefined&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; I[&quot;symbol&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; J[&quot;bigint&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;Literal: &#39;hello&#39;&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;Literal: 42&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[&quot;Literal: true&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"TypeScript Types\"] --&gt; B[\"Primitive Types\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Object Types\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"string\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"number\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"boolean\"]\n    B --&gt; G[\"null\"]\n    B --&gt; H[\"undefined\"]\n    B --&gt; I[\"symbol\"]\n    B --&gt; J[\"bigint\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"Literal: 'hello'\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"Literal: 42\"]\n    F --&gt; F1[\"Literal: true\"]</pre><h2 id=\"基本语法\">基本语法</h2><h3 id=\"七种原始类型\">七种原始类型</h3><p>TypeScript 为 JavaScript 的每一种原始值都提供了对应的类型关键字：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const name: string = &#39;TypeScript&#39;;&#10;const version: number = 5.4;&#10;const isStable: boolean = true;&#10;const nothing: null = null;&#10;const notDefined: undefined = undefined;&#10;const id: symbol = Symbol(&#39;id&#39;);&#10;const bigNum: bigint = 9007199254740991n;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'TypeScript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isStable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nothing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> notDefined</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> symbol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Symbol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigNum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 9007199254740991</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p>注意：<code>string</code>、<code>number</code>、<code>boolean</code> 是小写的原始类型。<code>String</code>、<code>Number</code>、<code>Boolean</code> 是包装对象类型，两者不同，<strong>永远不要使用包装对象类型作为注解</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ❌ 错误：使用了包装对象类型&#10;const bad: String = &#39;hello&#39;;&#10;&#10;// ✅ 正确：使用原始类型&#10;const good: string = &#39;hello&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 错误：使用了包装对象类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 正确：使用原始类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> good</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"null-与-undefined\"><code>null</code> 与 <code>undefined</code></h3><p>在严格模式（<code>strictNullChecks: true</code>）下，<code>null</code> 和 <code>undefined</code> 是独立的类型，不能赋值给其他类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"let value: string;&#10;value = &#39;hello&#39;; // ✅&#10;value = null; // ❌ 严格模式下报错&#10;value = undefined; // ❌ 严格模式下报错&#10;&#10;let nullable: string | null = null; // ✅ 需要联合类型\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 严格模式下报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 严格模式下报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nullable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 需要联合类型</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"symbol-与-unique-symbol\"><code>symbol</code> 与 <code>unique symbol</code></h3><p><code>symbol</code> 类型表示所有 Symbol 值。<code>unique symbol</code> 是 <code>symbol</code> 的子类型，只能用 <code>const</code> 声明，用于需要唯一标识的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const sym1: unique symbol = Symbol(&#39;key&#39;);&#10;const sym2: unique symbol = Symbol(&#39;key&#39;);&#10;&#10;// sym1 和 sym2 是不同的 unique symbol 类型&#10;type Check = typeof sym1 extends typeof sym2 ? true : false; // false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sym1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> unique</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> symbol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Symbol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'key'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sym2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> unique</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> symbol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Symbol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'key'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// sym1 和 sym2 是不同的 unique symbol 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Check</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sym1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extends</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sym2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// false</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"字面量类型\">字面量类型</h2><p>字面量类型将类型收窄为某个<strong>特定的值</strong>。TypeScript 支持字符串字面量、数字字面量和布尔字面量三种：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Direction = &#39;north&#39; | &#39;south&#39; | &#39;east&#39; | &#39;west&#39;;&#10;type DiceRoll = 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6;&#10;type Switch = true | false;&#10;&#10;function move(direction: Direction): void {&#10;  console.log(`Moving ${direction}`);&#10;}&#10;&#10;move(&#39;north&#39;); // ✅&#10;move(&#39;up&#39;); // ❌ 类型 &#39;&quot;up&quot;&#39; 不能赋值给类型 &#39;Direction&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Direction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'north'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'south'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'east'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'west'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DiceRoll</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Switch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`Moving ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">direction</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'north'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'up'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 类型 '\"up\"' 不能赋值给类型 'Direction'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>字面量类型单独使用意义不大，但与<strong>联合类型</strong>结合后，可以精确限定参数的可选范围，替代传统枚举或魔法字符串。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模板字面量类型\">模板字面量类型</h3><p>TypeScript 支持通过模板字符串语法组合字面量类型，生成新的字符串字面量联合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Color = &#39;red&#39; | &#39;blue&#39;;&#10;type Size = &#39;small&#39; | &#39;large&#39;;&#10;type Style = `${Size}-${Color}`;&#10;// 等价于 &quot;small-red&quot; | &quot;small-blue&quot; | &quot;large-red&quot; | &quot;large-blue&quot;&#10;&#10;type EventName = `on${Capitalize&lt;&#39;click&#39; | &#39;focus&#39;&gt;}`;&#10;// 等价于 &quot;onClick&quot; | &quot;onFocus&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'red'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'blue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'small'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'large'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Style</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Size</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}-${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Color</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等价于 \"small-red\" | \"small-blue\" | \"large-red\" | \"large-blue\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `on${</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Capitalize</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'click'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'focus'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 等价于 \"onClick\" | \"onFocus\"</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Color: &#39;red&#39; | &#39;blue&#39;&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;Template Combination&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;Size: &#39;small&#39; | &#39;large&#39;&quot;] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;&#39;small-red&#39;&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;&#39;small-blue&#39;&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;&#39;large-red&#39;&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;&#39;large-blue&#39;&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Color: 'red' | 'blue'\"] --&gt; C[\"Template Combination\"]\n    B[\"Size: 'small' | 'large'\"] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[\"'small-red'\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"'small-blue'\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"'large-red'\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"'large-blue'\"]</pre><h2 id=\"类型推断行为\">类型推断行为</h2><h3 id=\"类型拓宽-type-widening\">类型拓宽（Type Widening）</h3><p>用 <code>let</code> 声明变量时，字面量值会被拓宽为对应的基础类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"let str = &#39;hello&#39;; // string（不是 &quot;hello&quot;）&#10;let num = 42; // number（不是 42）&#10;let bool = true; // boolean（不是 true）&#10;&#10;const constStr = &#39;hello&#39;; // &quot;hello&quot;（字面量类型，不拓宽）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> str </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// string（不是 \"hello\"）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// number（不是 42）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bool </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// boolean（不是 true）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> constStr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"hello\"（字面量类型，不拓宽）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对象属性也会拓宽：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const config = {&#10;  url: &#39;https://api.example.com&#39;,&#10;  method: &#39;GET&#39;,&#10;};&#10;// config.method 的类型是 string，而非 &quot;GET&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://api.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// config.method 的类型是 string，而非 \"GET\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"as-const-断言\"><code>as const</code> 断言</h3><p><code>as const</code>（const 断言）可以阻止类型拓宽，将值推断为最窄的字面量类型，同时标记为 <code>readonly</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const config = {&#10;  url: &#39;https://api.example.com&#39;,&#10;  method: &#39;GET&#39;,&#10;} as const;&#10;// config.method 的类型是 &quot;GET&quot;&#10;// config 的类型是 { readonly url: &quot;https://api.example.com&quot;; readonly method: &quot;GET&quot; }&#10;&#10;const colors = [&#39;red&#39;, &#39;green&#39;, &#39;blue&#39;] as const;&#10;// 类型为 readonly [&quot;red&quot;, &quot;green&quot;, &quot;blue&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  url: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://api.example.com'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  method: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// config.method 的类型是 \"GET\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// config 的类型是 { readonly url: \"https://api.example.com\"; readonly method: \"GET\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> colors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'red'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'green'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'blue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型为 readonly [\"red\", \"green\", \"blue\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Object/Array Literal&quot;] --&gt; B{Using as const?}&#10;    B -- No --&gt; C[&quot;Properties Widened to Base Type&lt;br/&gt;method: string&quot;]&#10;    B -- Yes --&gt; D[&quot;Preserve Literal Type + readonly&lt;br/&gt;method: &#39;GET&#39;&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Object/Array Literal\"] --&gt; B{Using as const?}\n    B -- No --&gt; C[\"Properties Widened to Base Type&lt;br/&gt;method: string\"]\n    B -- Yes --&gt; D[\"Preserve Literal Type + readonly&lt;br/&gt;method: 'GET'\"]</pre><h3 id=\"类型收窄-type-narrowing\">类型收窄（Type Narrowing）</h3><p>字面量类型与联合类型搭配时，可以通过条件检查收窄类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Status = &#39;loading&#39; | &#39;success&#39; | &#39;error&#39;;&#10;&#10;function handleStatus(status: Status): string {&#10;  switch (status) {&#10;    case &#39;loading&#39;:&#10;      return &#39;加载中...&#39;;&#10;    case &#39;success&#39;:&#10;      return &#39;加载成功&#39;;&#10;    case &#39;error&#39;:&#10;      return &#39;加载失败&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'loading'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'success'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handleStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (status) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'loading'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '加载中...'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'success'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '加载成功'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '加载失败'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><h3 id=\"误区一-字面量联合与枚举混淆\">误区一：字面量联合与枚举混淆</h3><p>字面量联合类型和枚举都能表示有限集合，但语义不同：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 字面量联合 — 编译后完全消失&#10;type Theme = &#39;light&#39; | &#39;dark&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 枚举 — 编译后生成运行时对象&#10;enum ThemeEnum {&#10;  Light = &#39;light&#39;,&#10;  Dark = &#39;dark&#39;,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 字面量联合 — 编译后完全消失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Theme</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'light'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dark'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 枚举 — 编译后生成运行时对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ThemeEnum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Light</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'light'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Dark</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dark'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>字面量联合更轻量，适合纯类型约束；枚举适合需要运行时遍历或反向映射的场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误区二-忽略-strictnullchecks\">误区二：忽略 <code>strictNullChecks</code></h3><p>关闭 <code>strictNullChecks</code> 后，<code>null</code> 和 <code>undefined</code> 可以赋值给任何类型，这会掩盖大量潜在错误：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// strictNullChecks: false 时不报错，但运行时可能崩溃&#10;function getLength(s: string): number {&#10;  return s.length; // 如果 s 是 null，运行时抛出 TypeError&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// strictNullChecks: false 时不报错，但运行时可能崩溃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getLength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 如果 s 是 null，运行时抛出 TypeError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"误区三-混淆-as-const-与类型注解\">误区三：混淆 <code>as const</code> 与类型注解</h3><p><code>as const</code> 是从值推断最窄类型，而注解是从类型约束值。两者方向相反：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// as const：从值到类型&#10;const a = &#39;hello&#39; as const; // 类型为 &quot;hello&quot;&#10;&#10;// 类型注解：从类型到值&#10;const b: &#39;hello&#39; = &#39;hello&#39;; // 类型为 &quot;hello&quot;，但注解更冗长\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// as const：从值到类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型为 \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型注解：从类型到值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型为 \"hello\"，但注解更冗长</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"类型层级关系\">类型层级关系</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顶层类型</td>\n<td><code>unknown</code></td>\n<td>所有类型都可以赋值给 <code>unknown</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础类型</td>\n<td><code>string</code>, <code>number</code>, <code>boolean</code> 等</td>\n<td><code>let s: string</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字面量类型</td>\n<td><code>&quot;hello&quot;</code>, <code>42</code>, <code>true</code></td>\n<td><code>const s = &quot;hello&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底层类型</td>\n<td><code>never</code></td>\n<td>不存在的值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    U[&quot;unknown (Top Type)&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;string&quot;]&#10;    U --&gt; N[&quot;number&quot;]&#10;    U --&gt; B[&quot;boolean&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; S1[&quot;&#39;hello&#39;&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; S2[&quot;&#39;world&#39;&quot;]&#10;    N --&gt; N1[&quot;42&quot;]&#10;    N --&gt; N2[&quot;3.14&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;true&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;false&quot;]&#10;    S1 --&gt; NV[&quot;never (Bottom Type)&quot;]&#10;    S2 --&gt; NV&#10;    N1 --&gt; NV&#10;    N2 --&gt; NV&#10;    B1 --&gt; NV&#10;    B2 --&gt; NV\">graph TD\n    U[\"unknown (Top Type)\"] --&gt; S[\"string\"]\n    U --&gt; N[\"number\"]\n    U --&gt; B[\"boolean\"]\n    S --&gt; S1[\"'hello'\"]\n    S --&gt; S2[\"'world'\"]\n    N --&gt; N1[\"42\"]\n    N --&gt; N2[\"3.14\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"true\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"false\"]\n    S1 --&gt; NV[\"never (Bottom Type)\"]\n    S2 --&gt; NV\n    N1 --&gt; NV\n    N2 --&gt; NV\n    B1 --&gt; NV\n    B2 --&gt; NV</pre><h2 id=\"与-javascript-的关系\">与 JavaScript 的关系</h2><p>JavaScript 没有字面量类型的概念——<code>typeof &quot;hello&quot;</code> 在运行时始终返回 <code>&quot;string&quot;</code>。TypeScript 的字面量类型完全是编译期的概念，用于在开发阶段捕获错误：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type HttpMethod = &#39;GET&#39; | &#39;POST&#39; | &#39;PUT&#39; | &#39;DELETE&#39;;&#10;&#10;function request(url: string, method: HttpMethod): void {&#10;  // ...&#10;}&#10;&#10;// TypeScript 编译期就能捕获拼写错误&#10;request(&#39;/api&#39;, &#39;PSOT&#39;); // ❌ 类型 &#39;&quot;PSOT&quot;&#39; 不能赋值给类型 &#39;HttpMethod&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HttpMethod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'GET'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'POST'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PUT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DELETE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">method</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HttpMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TypeScript 编译期就能捕获拼写错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PSOT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 类型 '\"PSOT\"' 不能赋值给类型 'HttpMethod'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译后，所有字面量类型信息被擦除，JavaScript 中只是普通的字符串比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>TypeScript 支持七种原始类型：<code>string</code>、<code>number</code>、<code>boolean</code>、<code>null</code>、<code>undefined</code>、<code>symbol</code>、<code>bigint</code>。</li>\n<li>字面量类型将类型精确到具体值，与联合类型结合可以替代枚举或魔法字符串。</li>\n<li>模板字面量类型可以通过模板语法组合生成新的字符串字面量联合。</li>\n<li><code>as const</code> 断言阻止类型拓宽，保留最窄的字面量类型并标记 <code>readonly</code>。</li>\n<li>始终启用 <code>strictNullChecks</code>，让 <code>null</code> 和 <code>undefined</code> 成为独立类型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原始类型与字面量类型","id":"原始类型与字面量类型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本语法","id":"基本语法"},{"level":3,"text":"七种原始类型","id":"七种原始类型"},{"level":3,"text":"`null` 与 `undefined`","id":"null-与-undefined"},{"level":3,"text":"`symbol` 与 `unique symbol`","id":"symbol-与-unique-symbol"},{"level":2,"text":"字面量类型","id":"字面量类型"},{"level":3,"text":"模板字面量类型","id":"模板字面量类型"},{"level":2,"text":"类型推断行为","id":"类型推断行为"},{"level":3,"text":"类型拓宽（Type Widening）","id":"类型拓宽-type-widening"},{"level":3,"text":"`as const` 断言","id":"as-const-断言"},{"level":3,"text":"类型收窄（Type Narrowing）","id":"类型收窄-type-narrowing"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":3,"text":"误区一：字面量联合与枚举混淆","id":"误区一-字面量联合与枚举混淆"},{"level":3,"text":"误区二：忽略 `strictNullChecks`","id":"误区二-忽略-strictnullchecks"},{"level":3,"text":"误区三：混淆 `as const` 与类型注解","id":"误区三-混淆-as-const-与类型注解"},{"level":2,"text":"类型层级关系","id":"类型层级关系"},{"level":2,"text":"与 JavaScript 的关系","id":"与-javascript-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型注解与类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/basic-types/type-annotations-and-inference"},"next":{"title":"数组、元组与枚举","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/basic-types/arrays-tuples-and-enums"}}